# Local datasets

The `.csv.example` files contain column headers only, with no patient or dataset
rows. They document the current schema; they are not training datasets.

Supply the real input datasets locally:

- diabetes.csv
- diabetes_dataset.csv
- heart_disease_uci.csv

The analysis notebooks use or produce these cleaned datasets:

- diabetes_clean.csv
- diabetes_dataset_clean.csv
- heart_clean.csv

Run notebooks with `notebooks/` as the working directory so their `../data/`,
`../models/`, and `../plots/` paths resolve correctly. The application dependency
list does not include every optional notebook dependency.
